lity amendments, and all target-specific leave-alone rulings.\n","duration_seconds":87039.997886,"num_turns":4,"usage":{"input_tokens":1527778,"output_tokens":74195,"thinking_tokens":41497,"cache_read_tokens":9703766,"total_tokens":1601973}}
